                        %mi Σ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}_\Sigma
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cantor-Schroeder-Bernstein+theorem"} Cantor-Schroeder-Bernstein theorem
              holds for
