                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi C
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}_C
              is the limit of Cauchy sequences of rational numbers (with modulus), while
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mi H
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{R}_H
              is the limit of Cauchy sequences of elements of
